Here are AI Tools for Front-End Developers:

---

## 1. GitHub Copilot

An AI-powered coding assistant that helps developers write HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and frameworks like React faster.
It suggests code snippets, completes functions, and improves productivity inside code editors.

---

## 2. OpenAI ChatGPT

An AI assistant that helps with debugging, code explanations, UI logic design, and generating front-end code structures.
It is useful for learning new frameworks and solving development issues quickly.

---

## 3. Vercel v0

An AI tool that generates UI components from text prompts.
It helps developers quickly create modern frontend layouts and components.

---

## 4. Figma AI

Built-in AI features inside Figma help generate design layouts, UI ideas, and design suggestions automatically.
It speeds up the UI/UX design process for front-end development.

---

## 5. Uizard

An AI-based tool that converts sketches or wireframes into digital UI designs.
It helps front-end developers quickly turn ideas into structured designs.

---

## 6. Tabnine

An AI code completion tool that predicts and suggests code in real time.
It supports multiple front-end technologies and improves coding speed.

---

## 7. Builder.io AI

Provides AI-assisted visual development for building responsive front-end interfaces.
It helps reduce manual coding efforts.

